+## Completed (Request 23)
+- Added bulk discount feature to lineDiscount in src/totals.js
+  - Lines with qty >= 10 get an additional 2.5% off
+  - Bulk discount is applied AFTER the existing (explicit or tier) discount
+  - Calculation: bulkDiscount = (lineTotal - firstDiscount) × 2.5%
+  - Result rounded to cents and clamped to [0, lineTotal]
+  - invoiceTotals includes bulk discount in the discount field
+  - VAT calculated on taxable amount after both discounts
+  - Formula: total = subtotal - (firstDiscount + bulkDiscount) + vat - voucher (clamped)
